"P3883900150" "Radiation Emission"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1434954307" "Team AoE Ally +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P1581759498" "The Radiation Emission power utilizes the healing properties of radiation to re-energize your allies. This power radiates out from the Rikti and restores some health to all nearby allies."

