// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P383811230" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Fire), Foe Minor DoT (Toxic), -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P707677651" "You lash our with your whip firing a bolt of hellfire from its tip corrupting your victim's very living essence dealing minor fire damage, minor toxic damage over time as well as reducing their damage resistance for a short time. Damage: Minor Recharge: Very Fast"
