// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demonlings 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2691191548" "Summon Demonlings"
// Power Help Text :
"P1375226976" "Call forth up to three demonlings (depending on your level) to do your bidding. The first demonling is adept at manipulating fire, the second blasts your foes with cold attacks and the third is able to wield hellfire to deal fire/toxic damage. You may only have three demonlings under your command at any given time. If you attempt to summon more demonlings, you can only replace those that have been lost in battle. If you already have your maximum allowed amount, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Lash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4276640465" "Lash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1786463861" "Close, High DMG(Fire), Foe -Res, Knockdown, Minor DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P79942798" "You channel unholy energies into your whip and Lash out at your foe dealing high fire damage causing toxic damage over time. Lash has longer range than most melee attacks will reduce the target's damage resistance and also has a chance to knockdown your target. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P849394724" "Lash is causing damage over time and reducing your damage resistance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2759161222" "{PlayerSource} slashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of Fire damage and decreases your damage resistance slightly!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crack Whip 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3113948439" "Crack Whip"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1768021794" "Short Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Fire), Foe -Res, Knockdown, DoT(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3969179973" "You channel hellfire into your whip and make an impressive sweep causing high fire damage to enemies within a wide cone and also cause some toxic damage over time. Whip Crack has a larger range than most melee cones. Targets that are struck will also have their resistance to damage reduced for a short time, may suffer toxic damage over time and may be knocked down. Damage: High, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P629249857" "Crack Whip is causing damage over time and reducing your damage resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demons 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1277955949" "Summon Demons"
// Power Help Text :
"P2662735811" "Summons forth one to two Demons (depending on your level) to do your bidding. The first demon summoned is cloaked in hellfire and has skin as hard as stone while the second demon manipulates flame. You may only have 2 Demons under your control at any given time. If you attempt to call more Demons, you can only replace the ones you have lost in battle. If you already have your maximum allowed number, the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Summon Demon Prince 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4266849718" "Summon Demon Prince"
// Power Help Text :
"P3691664101" "Summons forth a foul Demon Prince from the deepest reaches of the Abyss. The Demon Prince is mighty among its kind and is a master of cold powers. It serves the conjuror only so that it may wreak havoc upon the material plane.  The Demon has some defense versus lethal, smashing, fire and cold attacks.  You may only have 1 Demon Prince under your control at any given time.  If you attempt to summon another Demon Prince the power will fail. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Twilight Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4164717180" "Twilight Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P442860801" "Ranged, Foe -To-hit -DMG, Team Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P2739304296" "You channel Negative Energy from the Netherworld through yourself to a targeted foe. Twilight Grasp drains the power from that target and slowly transfers it to you and all nearby allies. The targeted foe's chance to hit and damage are reduced, while you and your nearby allies are healed. Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3035092797" "-To-hit, -DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2083002603" "The Twilight Grasp has reduced your chance to hit and Damage potential."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3039724924" "{PlayerSource} captures you in their {PowerName}, reducing your damage, to-hit and regeneration rate!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tar Patch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1281699562" "Tar Patch"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2412290026" "Ranged (Location AoE), Target -Speed, -Res, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2097823509" "Drops a large patch of viscous Negative Energy which dramatically slows down enemies that run through it and reduces their damage resistance. Affected targets stuck in the Tar Patch cannot jump or fly. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2018496806" "-SPD, -Res, -Fly"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2237864073" "Your Running speed and damage resistance is reduced by the Tar Patch.  You cannot jump or fly away while in the Tar Patch"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Darkest Night 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1936194933" "Darkest Night"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3571933827" "Toggle: Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -DMG -To-hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P818477131" "While active, you channel Negative Energy onto a targeted foe. Darkest Night decreases the damage potential and chance to hit of the target, and all foes nearby, as long as you keep the power active. Recharge: Moderate"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4024386588" "Your {PowerName} reduced the damage and chance to hit of {PlayerDest} and all foes nearby."
