// Display Name :
"P2883527643" "Chemical Ammunition"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2750922835" "Ammo Change (Toxic), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4206547774" "You've swapped your ammunition and are now equipped with 'Chemical Rounds.'  Most of your Dual Pistol attacks will have their secondary damage converted to toxic damage and inflict a minor damage debuff effect on the target."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Toxic Pistol 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P398205339" "Toxic Pistol"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P418306962" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1617853395" "Quickly fires a round from one of your heavy automatic pistols. Damage is average, but the fire rate is very fast.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3081127037" "The Toxic blasts have reduced your damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2914276750" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Twin Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3327812983" "Twin Pistols"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P684893882" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3641815623" "Dual Wield fires both pistols in rapid succession at its desired target.  This power is slower than Pistols, but deals more damage, and the target may get knocked down by the force of the impact. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3681708404" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empty Cells 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P474371121" "Empty Cells"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1399859179" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2032745824" "You empty the clips of both your pistols in an arc of suppression fire. This attack can blast multiple foes in the affected cone area, and has a small chance of knocking some foes down. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Toxic Rain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3367054173" "Toxic Rain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1571581867" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P158827151" "You fire your pistols faster than the human eye can follow, causing your bullet trajectory to arc, dealing moderate Lethal damage and possibly knocking your foes back.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1002949227" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you back with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Executioner's Shot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2457212500" "Executioner's Shot"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3226463989" "Close, High DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P1595276707" "Executioner's Shot is a deadly close range attack.  Foes struck by this attack will suffer lethal damage and will likely be knocked back by the impact of this attack.  Damage: High, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Piercing Rounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1233880528" "Piercing Rounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P890029881" "Narrow Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Lethal/Special), Foes -Res(All)/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P863076175" "You fire your pistols with deadly precision in a very narrow cone, piercing your enemy.  Piercing Rounds deals High lethal damage and reduces targets' Damage Resistance for a short time. Damage: High Recharge: Long  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from a resistance debuff to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3450006853" "-Res"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1082335866" "The Toxic blasts have reduced your damage resistance."

